						{ t = "note", text = "Contested zone: Horde players quest here too, from Zoram'gar Outpost (west coast) and Splintertree Post (east). Their quests use the same spots as this guide: the Zoram Strand nagas, the Thistlefur camp north of Astranaar, the Foulweald, Mystral Lake. Stay grouped there." },
